{"id":"32e50ab8f941fd9b","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-quadcut.md","title":"Nonnegative-capacity network for a submodular quadratic","display":"df-quadcut — Nonnegative-capacity network for a submodular quadratic","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-quadcut","aliases":["27-df-quadcut"],"display":"df-quadcut — Nonnegative-capacity network for a submodular quadratic","depends_on":["[[27-df-quadpb]]","[[27-df-submodular]]","[[27-df-pbcoeff]]","[[27-thm-quadsubmodchar]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§13.6.3","source_statement":"Explicit local construction for the network reduction discussed on p.603","source_printed_pages":"603","source_pdf_pages":"627","verification_status":"proved-in-note-source-context-checked","local_review_status":"2026-10-20-formalization-reviewed-source-text-not-rechecked","local_revision_status":"formal-audit-2026-10-20; source-not-rechecked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-quadcut"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-quadcut</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-quadcut — Nonnegative-capacity network for a submodular quadratic"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"db1311544a44ed95\" href=\"?note=db1311544a44ed95\" title=\"27-df-quadpb\">27-df-quadpb</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9c7a7ba711a14913\" href=\"?note=9c7a7ba711a14913\" title=\"27-df-submodular\">27-df-submodular</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7937ecc11ac59760\" href=\"?note=7937ecc11ac59760\" title=\"27-df-pbcoeff\">27-df-pbcoeff</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fb0ee9f563db54d8\" href=\"?note=fb0ee9f563db54d8\" title=\"27-thm-quadsubmodchar\">27-thm-quadsubmodchar</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§13.6.3"},{"key":"source_statement","html":"Explicit local construction for the network reduction discussed on p.603"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"603"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"627"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note-source-context-checked"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"2026-10-20-formalization-reviewed-source-text-not-rechecked"},{"key":"local_revision_status","html":"formal-audit-2026-10-20; source-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\\in\\mathrm{QuadPB}_n\\cap\\mathrm{Submodular}_n\">\\(q\\in\\mathrm{QuadPB}_n\\cap\\mathrm{Submodular}_n\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"db1311544a44ed95\" href=\"?note=db1311544a44ed95\" title=\"27-df-quadpb\">27-df-quadpb</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"9c7a7ba711a14913\" href=\"?note=9c7a7ba711a14913\" title=\"27-df-submodular\">27-df-submodular</a>）；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\(N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_q\">\\(c_q\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"7937ecc11ac59760\" href=\"?note=7937ecc11ac59760\" title=\"27-df-pbcoeff\">27-df-pbcoeff</a>），二次系数符号判据（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"fb0ee9f563db54d8\" href=\"?note=fb0ee9f563db54d8\" title=\"27-thm-quadsubmodchar\">27-thm-quadsubmodchar</a>）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"c\\coloneqq c_q(\\varnothing),\\qquad a_i\\coloneqq c_q(\\{i\\})\\;(i\\in N),\\qquad b_{ij}\\coloneqq c_q(\\{i,j\\})\\;(1\\leq i&lt;j\\leq n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[c\\coloneqq c_q(\\varnothing),\\qquad a_i\\coloneqq c_q(\\{i\\})\\;(i\\in N),\\qquad b_{ij}\\coloneqq c_q(\\{i,j\\})\\;(1\\leq i&lt;j\\leq n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall i\\in N\\;\\left(d_i\\coloneqq a_i+\\frac12\\sum_{j\\in N\\setminus\\{i\\}}b_{\\min\\{i,j\\},\\max\\{i,j\\}}\\right),\\qquad\\kappa(q)\\coloneqq c+\\sum_{i\\in N}\\min\\{d_i,0\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall i\\in N\\;\\left(d_i\\coloneqq a_i+\\frac12\\sum_{j\\in N\\setminus\\{i\\}}b_{\\min\\{i,j\\},\\max\\{i,j\\}}\\right),\\qquad\\kappa(q)\\coloneqq c+\\sum_{i\\in N}\\min\\{d_i,0\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s\\coloneqq0,\\quad t\\coloneqq n+1,\\quad W_q\\coloneqq N\\cup\\{s,t\\},\\quad\\gamma_q:W_q\\times W_q\\to\\mathbb R_{\\geq0},\\quad\\gamma_q(u,v)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\max\\{d_v,0\\}&amp;u=s\\land v\\in N,\\\\\\max\\{-d_u,0\\}&amp;u\\in N\\land v=t,\\\\-\\frac12b_{\\min\\{u,v\\},\\max\\{u,v\\}}&amp;u,v\\in N\\land u\\neq v,\\\\0&amp;(u,v)\\notin(\\{s\\}\\times N)\\cup(N\\times\\{t\\})\\cup\\{(i,j)\\in N^2\\mid i\\neq j\\}.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s\\coloneqq0,\\quad t\\coloneqq n+1,\\quad W_q\\coloneqq N\\cup\\{s,t\\},\\quad\\gamma_q:W_q\\times W_q\\to\\mathbb R_{\\geq0},\\quad\\gamma_q(u,v)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\max\\{d_v,0\\}&amp;u=s\\land v\\in N,\\\\\\max\\{-d_u,0\\}&amp;u\\in N\\land v=t,\\\\-\\frac12b_{\\min\\{u,v\\},\\max\\{u,v\\}}&amp;u,v\\in N\\land u\\neq v,\\\\0&amp;(u,v)\\notin(\\{s\\}\\times N)\\cup(N\\times\\{t\\})\\cup\\{(i,j)\\in N^2\\mid i\\neq j\\}.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_q\\coloneqq\\{S\\subseteq W_q\\mid s\\in S\\land t\\notin S\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{Cap}_q(S)\\coloneqq\\sum_{u\\in S}\\sum_{v\\in W_q\\setminus S}\\gamma_q(u,v)\\;(S\\in\\mathcal C_q).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal C_q\\coloneqq\\{S\\subseteq W_q\\mid s\\in S\\land t\\notin S\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{Cap}_q(S)\\coloneqq\\sum_{u\\in S}\\sum_{v\\in W_q\\setminus S}\\gamma_q(u,v)\\;(S\\in\\mathcal C_q).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"S_n(x)\\coloneqq\\{s\\}\\cup\\{i\\in N\\mid x_i=0\\}\\;(x\\in\\mathbb B^n),\\qquad X_n(S)\\coloneqq\\{(i,0)\\mid i\\in S\\cap N\\}\\cup\\{(i,1)\\mid i\\in N\\setminus S\\}\\;(S\\in\\mathcal C_q).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[S_n(x)\\coloneqq\\{s\\}\\cup\\{i\\in N\\mid x_i=0\\}\\;(x\\in\\mathbb B^n),\\qquad X_n(S)\\coloneqq\\{(i,0)\\mid i\\in S\\cap N\\}\\cup\\{(i,1)\\mid i\\in N\\setminus S\\}\\;(S\\in\\mathcal C_q).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CutCap}_q:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb R_{\\geq0},\\qquad\\mathrm{CutCap}_q(x)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Cap}_q(S_n(x))\\quad(x\\in\\mathbb B^n),\\qquad\\mathrm{MinCut}(q)\\coloneqq\\min_{S\\in\\mathcal C_q}\\operatorname{Cap}_q(S).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{CutCap}_q:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb R_{\\geq0},\\qquad\\mathrm{CutCap}_q(x)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Cap}_q(S_n(x))\\quad(x\\in\\mathbb B^n),\\qquad\\mathrm{MinCut}(q)\\coloneqq\\min_{S\\in\\mathcal C_q}\\operatorname{Cap}_q(S).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是原书 p.603 二次 submodular 最小化与 network min-cut 对应的显式本地构造；书中该页只叙述对应关系，没有给出此半系数容量公式。q 的唯一多线性系数保证构造不依赖表示；符号判据给出 b_ij≤0，所以每条容量非负。x_i=0 表示顶点 i 位于 source 一侧。每条无向 pair edge 由两个同容量反向弧表示；割中恰有其中一条被计入。所有分支互斥且覆盖 W_q²，零容量允许。没有把图割仅重新命名成任意向量的目标函数。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-quadpb","status":"resolved","id":"db1311544a44ed95","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-quadpb]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-submodular","status":"resolved","id":"9c7a7ba711a14913","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-submodular]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pbcoeff","status":"resolved","id":"7937ecc11ac59760","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-pbcoeff]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-thm-quadsubmodchar","status":"resolved","id":"fb0ee9f563db54d8","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-thm-quadsubmodchar]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-quadpb","status":"resolved","id":"db1311544a44ed95","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$q\\in\\mathrm{QuadPB}_n\\cap\\mathrm{Submodular}_n$（see [[27-df-quadpb]], [[27-df-submodular]]）；$N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$，$c_q$（see [[27-df-pbcoeff]]），二次系数符号判据（see [[27-thm-quadsubmodchar]]）。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-submodular","status":"resolved